  "id": "point-4-17",
  "title": "Exceptions",
  "shortSummary": "介绍 exception 的基本模型：抛出、传播与捕获，说明它如何把错误处理与控制流分离。",
  "keyTerms": [
    "exception",
    "throw",
    "catch",
    "stack unwinding"
  ],
